      "display_name": "Burrower Mite-Louse",
      "kind": "fauna",
      "faction_id": "",
      "description": "A long pale predator that the decontamination teams took to calling mites after the second winter. They come up through fractured foundations, sidle along buried culverts, and they are gone before the lamps come back on. The first sign is the dust on the floor and the second sign is the last man standing.",
