      "display_name": "Spore-Bloated Hound",
      "kind": "fauna",
      "faction_id": "",
      "description": "A scavenger hound that picked up the wrong metabolism in the high-fallout drift east of Cut Ridge. It coughs spore plumes when it charges and the spores stay in the lungs for days. It is rare. The ones you see are the ones you will soon see again.",
      "base_health": 90.0,
      "base_armor_rating": 0.15,
