      "display_name": "Ash-Backed Boar",
      "kind": "fauna",
      "faction_id": "",
      "description": "A boar that survived the exchange in a fallout bunker meat locker and came out heavier and worse-tempered. The hide is calcified ash and old grease and the tusks still work. It does not run from a vehicle and it does not yield cover. Charge first, talk never.",
